#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:632
msgid ""
"The <quote><guilabel>Input</guilabel></quote> tab shown in <xref "
"linkend=\"histogram-tool-dialog\"/> contains the field specifying the data "
"to be used for the histogram."
msgstr ""
"Fliken <quote><guilabel>Indata</guilabel></quote> i <xref "
"linkend=\"histogram-tool-dialog\"/> innehåller fältet där du anger vilka "
"data som ska användas i histogrammet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:651
msgid "The <quote><guilabel>Cutoffs</guilabel></quote> Tab"
msgstr "Fliken <quote><guilabel>Gränsvärden</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:653
msgid "Histogram Tool Dialog <quote><guilabel>Cutoffs</guilabel></quote> Tab"
msgstr ""
"Histogramverktygets dialogruta – fliken "
"<quote><guilabel>Gränsvärden</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:655
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-"
"cutoffs.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image "
"of the dialog to generate various histograms open to the \"Cutoffs\" "
"tab.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-"
"cutoffs.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av "
"histogramdialogrutan med fliken Gränsvärden öppen.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:668
msgid ""
"The cutoffs for the histogram can either be predetermined by data contained "
"in your workbook or calculated by the histogram tool. These cutoffs "
"determine bins as defined by the selection on the "
"<quote><guilabel>Bins</guilabel></quote> tab."
msgstr ""
"Histogrammets gränsvärden kan hämtas från data i arbetsboken eller beräknas "
"av histogramverktyget. Gränsvärdena avgör klassindelningen enligt "
"inställningarna på fliken <quote><guilabel>Grupper</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:674
msgid ""
"Select the <quote><guilabel>Predetermined Cutoffs</guilabel></quote> option "
"to specify data on your worksheet in the <quote><guilabel>Cutoff "
"Range:</guilabel></quote> entry. The values in this range will be used as "
"cutoffs <parameter>c<subscript>1</subscript></parameter>, "
"<parameter>c<subscript>2</subscript></parameter>, and so on to "
"<parameter>c<subscript>n</subscript></parameter>."
msgstr ""
"Välj <quote><guilabel>Förutbestämda gränsvärden</guilabel></quote> om du "
"vill ange värden från kalkylbladet i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Gränsvärdesområde:</guilabel></quote>. Värdena i området "
"används som gränsvärden <parameter>c<subscript>1</subscript></parameter>, "
"<parameter>c<subscript>2</subscript></parameter> och så vidare upp till "
"<parameter>c<subscript>n</subscript></parameter>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:681
msgid ""
"Select the <quote><guilabel>Calculated Cutoffs</guilabel></quote> option to "
"have the cutoffs determined by the tool. Enter the desired number of cutoffs"
" in the <quote><guilabel>Number of Cutoffs</guilabel></quote> entry. It is "
"strongly recommended (but optional) that you specify the minimum and maximum"
" cutoffs in the <quote><guilabel>Minimum cutoff</guilabel></quote> and "
"<quote><guilabel>Maximum cutoff</guilabel></quote> entries. If the minimum "
"or maximum cutoff is not specified, the tool will use the minimum and/or "
"maximum of the current data."
msgstr ""
"Välj <quote><guilabel>Beräknade gränsvärden</guilabel></quote> om verktyget "
"ska beräkna gränsvärdena. Ange önskat antal i fältet <quote><guilabel>Antal "
"gränsvärden</guilabel></quote>. Vi rekommenderar starkt, men det är "
"valfritt, att du anger lägsta och högsta gränsvärde i fälten "
"<quote><guilabel>Minsta gränsvärde</guilabel></quote> och "
"<quote><guilabel>Största gränsvärde</guilabel></quote>. Om du inte anger ett"
" lägsta eller högsta gränsvärde använder verktyget det minsta respektive "
"största värdet i de aktuella data."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:692
msgid "The <quote><guilabel>Bins</guilabel></quote> Tab"
msgstr "Fliken <quote><guilabel>Grupper</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:694
msgid "Histogram Tool Dialog <quote><guilabel>Bins Tab</guilabel></quote>"
msgstr ""
"Histogramverktygets dialogruta – fliken "
"<quote><guilabel>Grupper</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:696
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-"
"bins.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of "
"the dialog to generate various histograms open to the \"Bins\" tab.</phrase>"
" </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-"
"bins.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av "
"histogramdialogrutan med fliken Grupper öppen.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:709
msgid ""
"The bins tab is used to determine how the cutoffs "
"<parameter>c<subscript>1</subscript></parameter>, "
"<parameter>c<subscript>2</subscript></parameter>, and so on to "
"<parameter>c<subscript>n</subscript></parameter> are translated into bins. "
"Specifically, it has to be determined whether first and/or last bins "
"reaching from −∞ to <parameter>c<subscript>1</subscript></parameter> and "
"from <parameter>c<subscript>n</subscript></parameter> to ∞ are added and "
"whether data points that much cutoffs exactly are included in the bin to the"
" right or the left."
msgstr ""
"På fliken Grupper anger du hur gränsvärdena "
"<parameter>c<subscript>1</subscript></parameter>, "
"<parameter>c<subscript>2</subscript></parameter> och så vidare upp till "
"<parameter>c<subscript>n</subscript></parameter> ska delas in i klasser. Du "
"väljer bland annat om en första klass från −∞ till "
"<parameter>c<subscript>1</subscript></parameter> och/eller en sista klass "
"från <parameter>c<subscript>n</subscript></parameter> till ∞ ska läggas "
"till, samt om datapunkter som exakt motsvarar ett gränsvärde ska räknas till"
" klassen till höger eller vänster."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:717
msgid ""
"For example the option <quote><guilabel>[∙,∙),[∙,∙),⋯, [∙,∙),[∙,∞) "
"</guilabel></quote> indicates that the first bin starts at the first cutoff "
"while the last bin ends at ∞. Moreover, each cutoff value belongs to the bin"
" on its right."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet <quote><guilabel>[∙,∙),[∙,∙),⋯, [∙,∙),[∙,∞) </guilabel></quote>"
" innebär till exempel att den första klassen börjar vid det första "
"gränsvärdet och att den sista slutar vid ∞. Varje gränsvärde räknas dessutom"
" till klassen till höger."
